// Signing configuration.
//
// The team ID lives in Local.xcconfig, which is gitignored, so it never reaches
// the repository. The "?" makes the include optional: without that file the
// project still builds, which is what CI and a fresh clone do.
//
// To build a signed or archivable app:  cp Local.xcconfig.example Local.xcconfig
#include? "Local.xcconfig"
